{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0011_1000_035hin", "source_sha256": "273d4adccb0e2baea533598dfd594387aba745ce7f2b6537d6b961a74f2097b2", "ja": "あのね、{$P$}のおかげで、\nあたしもちょびっとはアイドルがわかってきたよお。", "zh": "那个呀，多亏了{$P$}，\n我好像对偶像稍微明白一点了唷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0011_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "80c37192d4c951bd52bcaaf8d57d810c5a5e9abfc4ab0994d264090a89c8aca2", "ja": "それでね、ファンのみんなにもっと喜んでもらうには、\nどうしたらいいんだろか？　教えてくれるかい？", "zh": "然后呀，我想知道该做些什么，\n才能让粉丝们觉得开心呢？你能告诉我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0011_1002_p", "source_sha256": "db12e2af02de86ac0910fc67f4adcd611529e5f2ef51bf83387208867cb3e771", "ja": "そうだな……一番大切なのは、\nひなたが笑顔を忘れないことかな。", "zh": "我想想……最重要的，\n应该是日向自己不要忘记笑容这点吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0011_1003_p", "source_sha256": "1c6baa24d8cef2295496faff3492d579dd752db30762bd0e919ad5b2983e42c7", "ja": "ひなたの笑顔は、ファンを元気にする力がある。\nだから今のまま頑張っていれば、大丈夫だよ。", "zh": "因为日向的笑容，有为粉丝带来活力的力量。\n所以照这样继续努力就可以了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0011_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "901d5302a490c444a3d43e208b93d5152426b0ece46eb7a9148407bca6b21e87", "ja": "えへへ……そうかい？　{$P$}に\nそう言われると、大丈夫そうな気がしてきたよぉ。", "zh": "嘿嘿……是吗？听到{$P$}这么说，\n总觉得好像就没问题了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0011_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "0fed81028757426b44c1ad3468b1648ad29f887a2ba6c3802b2e947d0c4a826c", "ja": "あたしの笑顔で、みんなをもっと、元気にしたいなぁ。\nしたっけ、これからもよろしくねぇ。", "zh": "我想用我的笑容，让大家更有活力。\n所以今后也请多指教啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
